      "player": "Opus Trash",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Wait, Ghoulraiser is showing as 3/2! It should be 2/2 base... Oh wait, Liliana's Devotee gives Zombies +1/+0! Ghoulraiser IS a Zombie! So it's 3/2. Nice synergy!\n\
\n\
Now for attacks. Opponent has Steel-Plume Marshal (3/3, sick) and 1 untapped Plains. They could have a combat trick. But I have Impeccable Timing ready (1W - 3 damage to attacking/blocking creature). Wait, Impeccable Timing only hits attacking or blocking creatures, so it would work if they block.\n\
\n\
Ghoulraiser is sick. I can attack with Liliana's Devotee (2/3), Ingenious Leonin (4/4), and Liliana's Elite (3/2). Opponent has Steel-Plume Marshal that could block - but it has summoning sickness so it CAN block.\n\
\n\
If Marshal blocks my 4/4 Leonin, it dies (4 damage vs 3 toughness) and deals 3 back (Leonin survives). If it blocks Elite (3/2), both die (3 vs 3, and 3 vs 2). If it blocks Devotee (2/3), neither dies (2 vs 3, 3 vs 3).\n\
\n\
